    "body": "Sorry this may not help to write a clear definition, but it might be noted that the *input* event fired by HTML isn't the same as the one being defined by [UI Events](https://w3c.github.io/uievents/#event-type-input), the former (fired on non textual `<input>` elements) uses the `Event` interface, while the latter (fired on textual `<input>`, `<textarea>` and content-editable elements) uses the `InputEvent` one and is always preceded by a *beforeinput* event, that HTML doesn't fire.  ",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
